### The cljd stale-artifact detour (worth knowing)

The first cljd run **passed but was lying**: it loaded `cljd-out/dao/await-test_test.dart` — a stale compiled v1 artifact predating the deletion — because `dart test` globs everything in `cljd-out/` and the cljd compile doesn't prune removed files. I `rm -rf test/cljd-out` and re-ran clean. File-set diff of the two runs:

- **Gone:** `dao/await-test_test.dart` (stale v1) and `yin/scratch-div-test_test.dart` (a second stale artifact — scratch test whose source was already deleted from the repo)
- **Gained:** `dao/space/positional-query-test_test.dart` (real source test the old `cljd-out` predated)

